{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>And Balak saw.</b> A man renowned for expertise in warfare, as it says (Judges 11:25): הֲטוֹב טוֹב אַתָּה מִבָּלָק בֶּן צִפּוֹר וְכוּ׳. He saw that Israel sought to pass through the land of Sihon, and when he did not let them pass, they destroyed him, and they saw that they were victorious not by means of military strategy."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:40:36.664017984Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}